flowchart LR
    Operator -->|typed command| API
    API -->|identity + intent| Policy
    Policy -->|allow / deny / require approval| Kernel
    Director[Autonomy Director] -->|advisory recommendation| Kernel
    Provider[Models and Providers] -->|untrusted structured result| Router
    Router --> Kernel
    Kernel -->|authorized work| Workflow
    Workflow --> Worker
    Worker -->|candidate result + evidence| Completion
    Completion -->|verified transition only| Kernel
